Do not auto-apply this from ambient human chat — this skill sets `disable-model-invocation: true`.
When a push-webhook handler passes a structured payload (`project`, `merge_request_iid`, `head_sha`,
`auto_post_authorized`), read `pr-gatekeeper/SKILL.md` and follow it. A human asking to review an MR
conversationally should route to `pr-review/SKILL.md` instead.

Phase index: `pr-gatekeeper/reference/phase-index.md`. Reference loads:
`pr-gatekeeper/reference/lazy-load-index.md`.
Read + comment only — no GitLab approve/merge, no remediation, no application source changes.
